  'Drivers carry food and know where people live, so Nolifa checks every driver before the first job. Staff compare your ID with your selfie. Photos are kept private.': 'Abashayeli bathwala ukudla futhi bayazi lapho abantu behlala khona, ngakho i-Nolifa ihlola umshayeli ngamunye ngaphambi komsebenzi wokuqala. Abasebenzi baqhathanisa i-ID yakho nesithombe sakho. Izithombe zigcinwa ziyimfihlo.',
  'Drivers have an SOS button that shares their location with our safety line.': 'Abashayeli banenkinobho ye-SOS yabelana ngendawo yabo nolayini wethu wokuphepha.',
  'Drivers never need to carry cash except on small cash orders.': 'Abashayeli abadingi ukuthwala imali ngaphandle kwama-oda amancane emali.',
  'Drivers report potholes, floods, crashes and roadblocks as they drive. A warning fades by itself unless another driver confirms it, and comes down when drivers say it is gone.': 'Abashayeli babika imigodi, izikhukhula, izingozi namabhulokhi lapho beshayela. Isexwayiso siyaphela ngokwaso ngaphandle uma omunye umshayeli eqinisekisa, futhi siyehla lapho abashayeli bethi sesihambile.',
  'Drivers: ID checked with FNB and Home Affairs, selfie match, payout account, vehicle and safety briefing. No verification, no jobs.': 'Abashayeli: i-ID ihlolwa nge-FNB ne-Home Affairs, ukufanisa i-selfie, i-akhawunti yezinkokhelo, imoto nezinkulumo zokuphepha. Akukho kuqinisekiswa, akukho majoba.',
