  'Every driver and farm carries a rating. Repeated low ratings pause the account for review.': 'Umshayeli ngamunye nepulazi ngalinye kuthwala izinga. Amazinga aphansi aphindaphindayo amisa i-akhawunti ukuze ibuyekezwe.',
  'Every driver is checked before going online. A safety line shares your location with the team if anything goes wrong.': 'Umshayeli ngamunye uyahlolwa ngaphambi kokungena ku-inthanethi. Ilayini yokuphepha yabelana ngendawo yakho neqembu uma kukhona okungahambi kahle.',
  'Every farm pays a small monthly platform fee that includes support, plus a commission on each sale. Move up when your sales make the lower commission worth it.': 'Ipulazi ngalinye likhokha imali encane yenkundla yenyanga ehlanganisa ukusekelwa, kanye nekhomishini ekuthengisweni ngakunye. Khuphukela phezulu uma ukuthengisa kwakho kwenza ikhomishini ephansi ifanele.',
  'Every number here is measured on this phone from your own answers and real weather. ': 'Wonke amanani lapha alinganiswe kule foni ngezimpendulo zakho nesimo sezulu sangempela. ',
  'Every number here is measured on this phone from your own answers and real weather. Each one shows how many cases it rests on. Small samples are marked, not hidden.': 'Wonke amanani lapha alinganiswe kule foni ngezimpendulo zakho nesimo sezulu sangempela. Ngalinye likhombisa ukuthi limile emacaleni amangaki. Amasampula amancane aphawulwa, awafihlwa.',
  'Every plant has a story. We help you hear it.': 'Isitshalo ngasinye sinendaba. Sikusiza uyizwe.',
  'Every post is backed by proof: a photo you took and an AI check on your phone.': 'Yonke into ethunyelwe isekelwa ubufakazi: isithombe osithathile nokuhlolwa kwe-AI efonini yakho.',
  'Every room has a temperature band. A reading outside it raises an alarm and holds that room\'s goods back from orders.': 'Ikamelo ngalinye linebanga lokushisa. Ukufundwa ngaphandle kwalo kuphakamisa i-alamu futhi kubamba impahla yekamelo kuma-oda.',
  'Everything for today is done.': 'Konke kwanamuhla kwenziwe.',
  'Everything here is true. Nolifa may check it and keep my ID and photos safely for verification under POPIA.': 'Konke okukhona lapha kuyiqiniso. I-Nolifa ingakuhlola futhi igcine i-ID nezithombe zami ngokuphepha ukuze kuqinisekiswe ngaphansi kwe-POPIA.',
  'Everything here is true. Nolifa may check it, keep my ID and photos safely for verification under POPIA, and share my farm profile (not my ID) with buyers and vets.': 'Konke okukhona lapha kuyiqiniso. I-Nolifa ingakuhlola, igcine i-ID nezithombe zami ngokuphepha ukuze kuqinisekiswe ngaphansi kwe-POPIA, futhi yabelane ngephrofayili yepulazi lami (hhayi i-ID yami) nabathengi nodokotela.',
