  'How it works: the AI follows the FAO-56 water balance used by agronomists. Each day the crop uses the weather\'s evaporation times a crop factor, ': 'Ukuthi isebenza kanjani: i-AI ilandela ibhalansi yamanzi ye-FAO-56 esetshenziswa odokotela bezolimo. Usuku ngalunye isitshalo sisebenzisa ukuhwamuka kwesimo sezulu esiphindwe isici sesitshalo, ',
  'How it works: the AI follows the FAO-56 water balance used by agronomists. Each day the crop uses the weather\'s evaporation times a crop factor, rain that reaches the roots refills the soil, and watering is advised only when the crop would run short. It is a rule-based model, not a neural network. It cannot see your soil, so a quick feel of the ground makes it far more accurate. It does not turn anything on by itself unless you link a smart valve.': 'Ukuthi isebenza kanjani: i-AI ilandela ibhalansi yamanzi ye-FAO-56 esetshenziswa odokotela bezolimo. Usuku ngalunye isitshalo sisebenzisa ukuhwamuka kwesimo sezulu esiphindwe isici sesitshalo, imvula efinyelela ezimpandeni igcwalisa umhlaba, futhi ukunisela kuthunyelwa kuphela uma isitshalo sizophelelwa. Kungumodeli osekelwe ezimpawini, hhayi inethiwekhi ye-neural. Ayibuboni umhlaba wakho, ngakho ukuwuzwa ngokushesha kuyenza ibe nembile kakhulu. Ayivuli lutho ngokwayo ngaphandle uma uxhuma ivalvu ehlakaniphile.',
