  'Infection of the udder. Milk turns watery, clotted or blood-stained and the quarter is hot and hard. ': 'Ukutheleleka kwesinqe. Ubisi luba namanzi, luqongelele noma lunamabala egazi futhi ikota ishisa futhi iqine. ',
