  'Need a borehole?': 'Udinga ibhorehole?',
  'Need a header row and at least one animal.': 'Kudingeka umugqa wesihloko okungenani isilwane esisodwa.',
  'Need more than a delivery driver can carry? Ask for a bakkie or a refrigerated truck to take stock from your farm to the warehouse. You see a price straight away, Nolifa confirms it, and you accept.': 'Udinga okungaphezu kwalokho umshayeli wokulethela angakuthwala? Cela ibhakede noma ilori elipholile lithathe isitoko sakho epulazini lisise enqolobaneni. Ubona intengo ngokushesha, i-Nolifa iyiqinisekise, bese uyayamukela.',
  'Needs a connection': 'Kudinga uxhumo',
  'Needs a vet': 'Kudinga udokotela wezilwane',
  'Needs an answer': 'Idinga impendulo',
  'Needs another person': 'Kudinga omunye umuntu',
  'Needs attention': 'Kudinga ukunakwa',
  'Neighbour': 'Umakhelwane',
  'Neighbour reports': 'Imibiko yomakhelwane',
  'Neighbours and the water provider are simulated here. Nothing you do reaches a real provider.': 'Omakhelwane nomhlinzeki wamanzi bafananisiwe lapha. Akukho okwenzayo okufinyelela kumhlinzeki wangempela.',
  'Neighbours nearby see it as soon as you save.': 'Omakhelwane abaseduze bayabona ngokushesha lapho ugcina.',
  'Neighbours order together and share the delivery.': 'Omakhelwane bayala ndawonye futhi babelana ngokulethwa.',
  'Neighbours see your name on orders and deliveries. Your email stays private.': 'Omakhelwane babona igama lakho kuma-oda nasekulethweni. I-imeyili yakho ihlala iyimfihlo.',
  'Neighbours, drivers and the water provider are simulated so you can try everything.': 'Omakhelwane, abashayeli nomhlinzeki wamanzi bafananisiwe ukuze uzame konke.',
  'Nerves': 'Imithambo yezinzwa',
  'New': 'Kusha',
  'New growth will be healthy once the plant is in a better position': 'Ukukhula okusha kuzophila lapho isitshalo sisesikhundleni esingcono',
  'New here?': 'Umusha lapha?',
  'New on Nolifa Drop': 'Okusha ku-Nolifa Drop',
  'New orders': 'Ama-oda amasha',
  'New orders, deliveries, payouts': 'Ama-oda amasha, ukulethwa, izinkokhelo',
  'New vet video': 'Ividiyo entsha yodokotela wezilwane',
  'Newcastle and Uthukela, supplied by the Ngagane and Tugela systems': 'I-Newcastle ne-Uthukela, ihlinzekwa izinhlelo ze-Ngagane ne-Tugela',
  'Next': 'Okulandelayo',
  'Next season scan for twins and feed late-pregnant females extra': 'Isizini ezayo skena amawele futhi unikeze abesifazane abakhulelwe sekwedlule ukudla okwengeziwe',
  'Nguni': 'INguni',
  'No Nolifa driver has reported a hazard recently. That does not mean the roads are clear: this is not a traffic report.': 'Akekho umshayeli we-Nolifa obike ingozi muva nje. Lokho akusho ukuthi imigwaqo icacile: lena akuyona umbiko wethrafikhi.',
  'No action after 2 hours: the farmer and driver are paid automatically, within minutes, to FNB account or Instant Money.': 'Akukho senzo ngemva kwamahora ama-2: umlimi nomshayeli bakhokhelwa ngokuzenzakalelayo, phakathi kwemizuzu, ku-akhawunti ye-FNB noma i-Instant Money.',
  'No action needed': 'Akukho okudingekayo',
  'No animals counted yet. Set your head count to see what they drink.': 'Awekho amazinga ezilwane abaliwe okwamanje. Setha inani lezinhloko ukuze ubone abakuphuzayo.',
  'No animals have a pin yet. Open an animal and drop a pin on the map.': 'Azikho izilwane ezinephini okwamanje. Vula isilwane ufake iphini kumephu.',
  'No animals yet': 'Azikho izilwane okwamanje',
  'No answers yet. After a scan, tap Yes, No or Not sure under the result. ': 'Azikho izimpendulo okwamanje. Ngemva kokuskena, thinta u-Yebo, Cha noma Angiqinisekile ngaphansi komphumela. ',
  'No answers yet. After a scan, tap Yes, No or Not sure under the result. That is how the app learns whether it is right in your fields.': 'Azikho izimpendulo okwamanje. Ngemva kokuskena, thinta u-Yebo, Cha noma Angiqinisekile ngaphansi komphumela. Yileyo ndlela uhlelo lufunda ngayo ukuthi lilungile yini emasimini akho.',
  'No bactericide available? Spray with a mixture of 1 tablespoon of copper sulphate dissolved in 10 litres of water. Apply every 5 days. Remove badly infected parts by hand.': 'Awukho umuthi we-bacteria? Fafaza ngengxube yesipuni esisodwa se-copper sulphate esichithwe emalitheni angu-10 amanzi. Faka njalo ezinsukwini ezi-5. Susa izingxenye ezithelelekile kakhulu ngesandla.',
  'No bank account needed': 'Akudingeki i-akhawunti yasebhange',
  'No cases yet.': 'Awekho amacala okwamanje.',
  'No cattle movement in this district. Check your herd register.': 'Akukho kunyakaza kwezinkomo kuleli sifunda. Hlola irejista yomhlambi wakho.',
  'No checks yet': 'Awekho amahlolo okwamanje',
  'No chemical control exists for the virus itself. Focus on controlling aphids with neem oil spray — 2 tablespoons per litre of water. Spray every 5 days.': 'Akukho ukulawula ngamakhemikhali kwegciwane ngokwalo. Gxila ekulawuleni ama-aphid ngokufafaza amafutha e-neem - izipuni ezi-2 ngelitha lamanzi. Fafaza njalo ezinsukwini ezi-5.',
  'No chemical control is effective for fusarium wilt once established. Soil solarisation using clear plastic sheeting in summer is the most accessible treatment without chemicals.': 'Akukho ukulawula ngamakhemikhali okusebenzayo ku-fusarium wilt uma sekuqinile. Ukushisa umhlaba ngelanga usebenzisa ipulasitiki elicacile ehlobo yindlela elula yokwelapha ngaphandle kwamakhemikhali.',
  'No chemical treatment needed for mild scab. Focus on consistent watering and adding acidic compost like pine needles or peat to lower soil pH naturally.': 'Akukho ukwelashwa ngamakhemikhali okudingekayo ku-scab encane. Gxila ekunisela njalo nasekungezeni ikhompositi enoshevu njengezinaliti zomhlambi noma i-peat ukwehlisa i-pH yomhlaba ngokwemvelo.',
  'No communities yet': 'Ayikho imiphakathi okwamanje',
  'No community is asking right now. When one reaches its vote target you see it here.': 'Akukho mphakathi ocela okwamanje. Uma omunye ufinyelela inhloso yawo yokuvota ubona lapha.',
  'No confirmed savings yet. When rain does the work of a watering and you confirm you held off, ': 'Awekho amanzi alondoloziwe aqinisekisiwe okwamanje. Lapho imvula yenza umsebenzi wokunisela futhi uqinisekisa ukuthi ushiye, ',
  'No confirmed savings yet. When rain does the work of a watering and you confirm you held off, the litres a daily schedule would have pumped are counted here. A delay is not a saving, so it is not counted.': 'Awekho amanzi alondoloziwe aqinisekisiwe okwamanje. Lapho imvula yenza umsebenzi wokunisela futhi uqinisekisa ukuthi ushiye, amalitha ucwaningo lwansuku zonke lwalungawadonsa abalwa lapha. Ukuhlehliswa akuyona ukonga, ngakho akubalwa.',
  'No crops yet. Add your first plot and get a harvest date.': 'Azikho izitshalo okwamanje. Engeza ithafa lakho lokuqala uthole usuku lokuvuna.',
  'No deals right now. Check back, new rescue deals appear when farms have surplus.': 'Azikho izivumelwano okwamanje. Buya, izivumelwano ezintsha zokusindisa zivela uma amapulazi enokweqile.',
  'No deposits are expected right now.': 'Azikho izinkokhelo ezilindelekile okwamanje.',
  'No diagnoses yet': 'Akukho ukuxilongwa okwamanje',
  'No disease or damage was detected on this plant. Keep doing what you are doing.': 'Asikho isifo noma umonakalo otholakele kulesi sitshalo. Qhubeka nalokho okwenzayo.',
  'No empty date': 'Ayikho usuku lokuphela',
  'No farms match. Try another word.': 'Awekho amapulazi afanayo. Zama elinye igama.',
  'No fertiliser available? Compost tea works well — soak compost in water for 24 hours and water your plant with the liquid. Banana peels buried near roots add potassium.': 'Awukho umanyolo? Itiye lekhompositi liyasebenza - cwilisa ikhompositi emanzini amahora angu-24 uphinde unisele isitshalo ngoketshezi. Amakhasi ebhanana angcwatshwe eduze nezimpande engeza i-potassium.',
  'No forecast yet. It needs a signal once, then it is saved for when you are offline.': 'Asikho isibikezelo okwamanje. Sidinga uphawu kanye, bese sigcinwa ukuze usisebenzise ungekho ku-inthanethi.',
  'No fungicide available? Dust the trimmed roots with cinnamon powder before replanting — it has natural antifungal properties. Ensure the new pot or planting area has good drainage.': 'Awukho umuthi wesikhunta? Fafaza izimpande ezinqunyiwe ngempuphu ye-cinnamon ngaphambi kokutshala kabusha - inezakhiwo zemvelo ezilwa nesikhunta. Qinisekisa ukuthi isitsha esisha noma indawo yokutshala iphuma amanzi kahle.',
  'No fungicide available? Mix 1 tablespoon of baking soda and a few drops of dish soap in 1 litre of water. Spray every 3 days on all affected areas.': 'Awukho umuthi wesikhunta? Hlanganisa isipuni esisodwa se-baking soda namaconsi ambalwa esepha yokuwasha izitsha kulitha elilodwa lamanzi. Fafaza njalo ezinsukwini ezi-3 kuzo zonke izindawo ezithintekile.',
  'No fungicide available? Mix 1 tablespoon of baking soda with 1 litre of water and a few drops of dish soap. Spray on affected leaves every 3 days.': 'Awukho umuthi wesikhunta? Hlanganisa isipuni esisodwa se-baking soda nelitha elilodwa lamanzi namaconsi ambalwa esepha yokuwasha izitsha. Fafaza amaqabunga athintekile njalo ezinsukwini ezi-3.',
  'No fungicide available? Mix 1 tablespoon of baking soda with 1 litre of water and spray on affected areas every 3 days. Remove badly affected leaves by hand.': 'Awukho umuthi wesikhunta? Hlanganisa isipuni esisodwa se-baking soda nelitha elilodwa lamanzi bese ufafaza izindawo ezithintekile njalo ezinsukwini ezi-3. Susa amaqabunga athintekile kakhulu ngesandla.',
  'No fungicide available? Remove all affected parts immediately and dust remaining healthy tissue with bicarbonate of soda. Improve ventilation as much as possible.': 'Awukho umuthi wesikhunta? Susa zonke izingxenye ezithintekile ngokushesha bese ufafaza izicubu eziphilile ezisele nge-bicarbonate yesoda. Thuthukisa ukungena komoya ngokusemandleni akho.',
  'No fungicide available? Remove infected leaves and ensure good spacing between plants for airflow. Mancozeb is widely available and affordable at most agridealers.': 'Awunayo i-fungicide? Susa amaqabunga athelelekile futhi uqinisekise ukuthi kunebanga elihle phakathi kwezitshalo ukuze kungene umoya. I-Mancozeb iyatholakala kakhulu futhi ayibizi kubathengisi bezolimo abaningi.',
  'No fungicide available? Remove infected leaves and improve airflow around plants. Crop rotation next season is the best long-term prevention.': 'Awukho umuthi wesikhunta? Susa amaqabunga athelelekile futhi uthuthukise ukugeleza komoya ezungeze izitshalo. Ukuzungezisa izitshalo ngesizini ezayo kungukuvikela okungcono kakhulu kwesikhathi eside.',
  'No fungicide available? Remove infected parts immediately and spray remaining plants with a mixture of 1 tablespoon copper sulphate dissolved in 10 litres of water.': 'Awukho umuthi wesikhunta? Susa izingxenye ezithelelekile ngokushesha bese ufafaza izitshalo ezisele ngengxube yesipuni esisodwa se-copper sulphate esichithwe emalitheni angu-10 amanzi.',
  'No fungicide available? Spray with baking soda solution — 1 tablespoon per litre of water with a few drops of dish soap every 3 days. Remove badly affected leaves by hand.': 'Awunayo i-fungicide? Fafaza ngesisombululo se-baking soda - isipuni esisodwa ngelitha lamanzi namaconsi ambalwa esepha yokuwasha izitsha njalo ezinsukwini ezi-3. Susa amaqabunga athelelekile kakhulu ngesandla.',
  'No help needed right now': 'Akudingeki usizo manje',
  'No insecticide available? Spray leaves with neem oil mixed with water — 2 tablespoons per litre. Focus on the underside of leaves. Repeat every 5 days.': 'Awukho umuthi wezinambuzane? Fafaza amaqabunga ngamafutha e-neem axutshwe namanzi - izipuni ezi-2 ngelitha. Qondisa ngaphansi kwamaqabunga. Phinda njalo ezinsukwini ezi-5.',
  'No insecticide available? Spray neem oil solution on remaining healthy plants to repel leafhoppers — 2 tablespoons per litre of water every 5 days.': 'Awunayo i-insecticide? Fafaza isisombululo samafutha e-neem ezitshalweni ezisele eziphilile ukuze uxoshe ama-leafhopper - izipuni ezi-2 ngelitha lamanzi njalo ezinsukwini ezi-5.',
  'No internet. Check your signal and try again.': 'Akukho inthanethi. Hlola uphawu lwakho uzame futhi.',
  'No jobs right now. Stay online. New ones appear as people order.': 'Awekho amajoba okwamanje. Hlala ku-inthanethi. Amasha avela njengoba abantu beyala.',
  'No limit': 'Akukho mkhawulo',
  'No location yet.': 'Alukho indawo okwamanje.',
  'No match': 'Akukho okufanayo',
  'No messages yet.': 'Azikho izimilayezo okwamanje.',
  'No open jobs right now. New ones appear as people order.': 'Awekho amajoba avulekile okwamanje. Amasha avela njengoba abantu beyala.',
  'No orders are passing through a hub right now.': 'Awekho ama-oda adlula nge-hab okwamanje.',
  'No orders yet': 'Awekho ama-oda okwamanje',
  'No orders yet. They show up here once your stock is shared with neighbours.': 'Awekho ama-oda okwamanje. Avela lapha uma isitoko sakho sabelwana nomakhelwane.',
  'No orders yet. Your stock is visible to neighbours nearby.': 'Awekho ama-oda okwamanje. Isitoko sakho sibonakala komakhelwane abaseduze.',
  'No outbreaks reported in this area. If you see something, report it so neighbours can prepare.': 'Akukho ukuqubuka kwezifo okubikiwe kule ndawo. Uma ubona okuthile, bika ukuze omakhelwane bazilungiselele.',
  'No outbreaks reported in your area. If you see something, report it so neighbours can prepare.': 'Akukho ukuqubuka kwezifo okubikiwe endaweni yakho. Uma ubona okuthile, bika ukuze omakhelwane bazilungiselele.',
  'No proof, no post. Your photo and the AI check go with it.': 'Akukho bufakazi, akukho okuthunyelwayo. Isithombe sakho nokuhlolwa kwe-AI kuhamba nakho.',
  'No reading': 'Alukho ulwazi',
  'No reading yet. The forecast stays blank until the provider publishes one.': 'Akukho ukufundwa okwamanje. Isibikezelo sihlala sineze kuze kube umhlinzeki eshicilela.',
  'No readings for your area yet': 'Akukho ukufundwa kwendawo yakho okwamanje',
  'No real readings available right now.': 'Akukho ukufundwa kwangempela okutholakalayo okwamanje.',
  'No reports exactly here, but outbreaks in the areas around it are spreading heat into this one.': 'Azikho izibiko lapha ngqo, kodwa ukuqubuka kwezifo ezindaweni eziyizungezile kusabalalisa ukushisa kule ndawo.',
  'No reports near you. Farmers file them in Nolifa Grow.': 'Ayikho imibiko eduze kwakho. Abalimi bayifaka ku-Nolifa Grow.',
  'No shade cloth available? Use an old bedsheet or hessian bag to create temporary shade during the hottest part of the day between 11am and 3pm.': 'Awunayo indwangu yomthunzi? Sebenzisa ingubo yokulala endala noma isaka le-hessian ukwenza umthunzi wesikhashana ngesikhathi esishisa kakhulu phakathi kwe-11am kanye ne-3pm.',
  'No sprinkler plan. The estimate assumes rain. Set one up to keep growth on track.': 'Alukho uhlelo lwesisakazi samanzi. Isilinganiso sicabanga imvula. Beka oluthile ukuze ukukhula kuhambe kahle.',
  'No system yet': 'Alukho uhlelo okwamanje',
  'No tag yet': 'Alukho ithegi okwamanje',
  'No tank saved yet. Add its size in your water plan.': 'Alikho ithange elilondoloziwe okwamanje. Engeza usayizi walo kuhlelo lwakho lwamanzi.',
  'No times set. Add one so the phone can remind you.': 'Azikho izikhathi ezibekiwe. Engeza esisodwa ukuze ifoni ikukhumbuze.',
  'No traffic data has arrived yet. It refreshes every 5 minutes.': 'Idatha yethrafikhi ayikafiki. Iyabuyekezwa njalo ngemizuzu emi-5.',
  'No traffic incidents within 25 km': 'Azikho izehlakalo zethrafikhi ngaphakathi kwama-25 km',
  'No treatment needed.': 'Akukho ukwelashwa okudingekayo.',
  'No trucks on the road': 'Awekho amaloli emgwaqweni',
  'No updates yet. When your municipality or water provider answers a community request, you see when help is coming here. Not every municipality helps farmers with water yet.': 'Azikho izibuyekezo okwamanje. Uma umasipala wakho noma umhlinzeki wamanzi ephendula isicelo somphakathi, ubona lapha ukuthi usizo luzofika nini. Akuwona wonke amasipala asiza abalimi ngamanzi okwamanje.',
  'No verified backups for this product yet.': 'Akukho abasekelayo abaqinisekisiwe walo mkhiqizo okwamanje.',
  'No verified cases or forecast risk': 'Awekho amacala aqinisekisiwe noma ingozi yesibikezelo',
  'No videos left this month': 'Awasekho amavidiyo kule nyanga',
  'No water at all': 'Awekho amanzi nhlobo',
  'No water reports yet. Take a photo of your tank or tap and share it.': 'Ayikho imibiko yamanzi okwamanje. Thatha isithombe setange noma sepompi uyabelane.',
  'No watering needed this week: the soil holds enough.': 'Akudingeki ukunisela kuleli sonto: umhlaba ubamba okwanele.',
  'No watering needed today': 'Akudingeki ukunisela namuhla',
  'No watering today. The soil still holds enough.': 'Akukho ukunisela namuhla. Umhlaba usabamba okwanele.',
  'No weather threats this week.': 'Awekho amathrethi esimo sezulu kuleli sonto.',
  'No, wrong': 'Cha, kungalungile',
  'Nobody pays to be warned or to ask for help.': 'Akekho okhokhela ukuxwayiswa noma ukucela usizo.',
  'Nolifa Delivery': 'I-Nolifa Delivery',
  'Nolifa Drop keeps': 'I-Nolifa Drop igcina',
  'Nolifa Drop lists farms that are registered, verified, on a plan and have shown their land. Keeps buyers safe.': 'I-Nolifa Drop ibhala amapulazi abhalisiwe, aqinisekisiwe, anohlelo futhi abonise umhlaba wawo. Igcina abathengi bephephile.',
  'Nolifa Grow is an AI-powered plant disease diagnostic tool built specifically for Southern African farmers, gardeners, and agricultural students.\n\nPoint your camera at any sick plant and get an instant diagnosis in plain language — what is wrong, how serious it is, and exactly what to do about it. No agricultural knowledge required.': 'I-Nolifa Grow yithuluzi lokuxilonga izifo zezitshalo elinamandla e-AI eliyakhelwe abalimi, abalimi bensimu nabafundi bezolimo baseNingizimu ne-Afrika.\\n\\nBhekisa ikhamera yakho kunoma yisiphi isitshalo esigulayo uthole ukuxilongwa ngokushesha ngolimi olulula - yini engalungile, ukuthi kubi kangakanani, nokuthi yini ongayenza. Akudingeki ulwazi lwezolimo.',
  'Nolifa Grow provides AI-generated diagnoses intended as a guide only. Results should not replace professional agricultural advice. Always consult a qualified agricultural expert or extension officer for serious crop concerns or before making significant treatment decisions.': 'I-Nolifa Grow inikeza ukuxilongwa okukhiqizwe yi-AI okuhloselwe ukuba isiqondiso kuphela. Imiphumela akufanele ithathe indawo yeseluleko sobungcweti sezolimo. Njalo xhumana nochwepheshe wezolimo oqeqeshiwe noma isisebenzi sokunweba ngezinkinga ezinkulu zezitshalo noma ngaphambi kokwenza izinqumo ezinkulu zokwelapha.',
  'Nolifa Grow was built by Mpumelelo Mthethwa, an Information Technology student and solo developer.\n\nBuilt specifically for Southern African farmers and gardeners who need fast, reliable answers about their plants, no agricultural knowledge required.': 'I-Nolifa Grow yakhiwa nguMpumelelo Mthethwa, umfundi wezobuchwepheshe bolwazi nonjiniyela ozimele.\\n\\nYakhelwe abalimi nabalimi bensimu baseNingizimu ne-Afrika abadinga izimpendulo ezisheshayo, ezethembekile ngezitshalo zabo, akudingeki ulwazi lwezolimo.',
  'Nolifa borehole': 'Ibhorehole ye-Nolifa',
  'Nolifa could not find your position. Move to open sky or check your signal, then try again.': 'I-Nolifa ayikwazanga ukuthola indawo yakho. Hamba ungaphansi kwezulu elivulekile noma uhlole isignali yakho, bese uyazama futhi.',
  'Nolifa does not switch your sprinkler. Run it on this schedule and the AI uses it to estimate your harvest.': 'I-Nolifa ayikuvulele isisakazi samanzi. Sisebenzise ngalolu hlelo futhi i-AI iluthatha ukulinganisa isivuno sakho.',
  'Nolifa is built for patchy signal. Some things work with none. Others need a connection, or another person.': 'I-Nolifa yakhelwe uphawu olungahambi kahle. Ezinye izinto zisebenza ngaphandle kwalo. Ezinye zidinga uxhumo, noma omunye umuntu.',
  'Nolifa is not allowed to use your location yet. Allow it to see alerts near you.': 'I-Nolifa ayikavunyelwa ukusebenzisa indawo yakho. Yivumele ukubona izixwayiso eziseduze nawe.',
  'Nolifa membership': 'Ubulungu be-Nolifa',
  'Nolifa switches your plan on when your payment is confirmed. Contact us to change it.': 'I-Nolifa ivula uhlelo lwakho lapho inkokhelo yakho iqinisekiswa. Xhumana nathi ukuze ushintshe.',
