  'Not happy with the decision? Ask for a second review. Escalation goes to FNB customer care.': 'Awuneliswanga yisinqumo? Cela ukubuyekezwa kwesibili. Ukukhuphula kuya ekunakekelweni kwamakhasimende e-FNB.',
