  'Solarise the soil — cover with clear plastic for 4 to 6 weeks in summer to kill fungus with heat': 'Shisa umhlaba ngelanga - wuvale ngepulasitiki elicacile amasonto angu-4 kuya kwangu-6 ehlobo ukubulala isikhunta ngokushisa',
