  'Some farms deliver themselves. Others use Nolifa Delivery, where a verified neighbour collects it. The farm card shows which.': 'Amanye amapulazi aziletha wona. Amanye asebenzisa i-Nolifa Delivery, lapho umakhelwane oqinisekisiwe elanda. Ikhadi lepulazi likhombisa ukuthi yiliphi.',
