  'Spray with a copper sulphate solution — 1 tablespoon per 10 litres of water. Apply every 5 days. Remove badly affected leaves by hand immediately.': 'Fafaza ngesisombululo se-copper sulphate - isipuni esisodwa emalitheni angu-10 amanzi. Faka njalo ezinsukwini ezi-5. Susa amaqabunga athintekile kakhulu ngesandla ngokushesha.',
  'Spray with a mixture of 1 tablespoon dish soap and 1 litre of water on leaf undersides every 3 days. Yellow sticky cards made from yellow cardboard coated in petroleum jelly also trap adults.': 'Fafaza ngengxube yesipuni esisodwa sesepha yokuwasha izitsha nelitha elilodwa lamanzi ngaphansi kwamaqabunga njalo ezinsukwini ezi-3. Amakhadi aphuzi enziwe ngekhadibhodi eliphuzi elimbozwe nge-petroleum jelly nawo abamba abadala.',
  'Spray with a mixture of 1 teaspoon of baking soda and a few drops of dish soap in 1 litre of water. Apply every 3 to 5 days on affected leaves.': 'Fafaza ngengxube yethisipuni elilodwa le-baking soda namaconsi ambalwa esepha yokuwasha izitsha kulitha elilodwa lamanzi. Faka njalo ezinsukwini ezi-3 kuya kwezi-5 emaqabungeni athintekile.',
  'Spray with baking soda solution — 1 tablespoon per litre of water with a few drops of dish soap. Apply every 3 days on affected areas.': 'Fafaza ngesisombululo se-baking soda - isipuni esisodwa ngelitha lamanzi namaconsi ambalwa esepha yokuwasha izitsha. Faka njalo ezinsukwini ezi-3 ezindaweni ezithintekile.',
  'Spray with copper sulphate solution — 1 tablespoon per 10 litres of water every 5 days. Remove infected leaves immediately and avoid working with wet plants.': 'Fafaza ngesisombululo se-copper sulphate - isipuni esisodwa emalitheni angu-10 amanzi njalo ezinsukwini ezi-5. Susa amaqabunga athelelekile ngokushesha futhi ugweme ukusebenza nezitshalo ezimanzi.',
  'Spray with insecticidal soap or neem oil focusing on leaf undersides': 'Fafaza ngesepha yezinambuzane noma amafutha e-neem uqonde ngaphansi kwamaqabunga',
  'Spread by the bont tick. Causes fever then nervous signs: high-stepping, circling and convulsions. ': 'Isakazwa yithikhi le-bont. Ibangela imfiva bese izimpawu zezinzwa: ukuhamba ngokuphakamisa, ukuzungeza nokuqhaqhazela. ',
