  'The camera is not available. Type the order code below.': 'Ikhamera ayitholakali. Thayipha ikhodi ye-oda ngezansi.',
  'The card page could not be opened. Try again.': 'Ikhasi lekhadi alivulekanga. Zama futhi.',
  'The community sees how many trucks are coming and when.': 'Umphakathi ubona ukuthi mangaki amaloli ayeza nokuthi nini.',
  'The community sees who is coming and when.': 'Umphakathi ubona ukuthi ubani oyeza nokuthi nini.',
  'The customer gives you a 4-digit PIN at the door. Delivery completes and you are paid when it matches. You are paid for the work: R12 a delivery plus R2.50 a km.': 'Ikhasimende likunika i-PIN enezinombolo ezi-4 emnyango. Ukulethwa kuyaphela futhi ukhokhelwa uma ifana. Ukhokhelwa ngomsebenzi owenzile: u-R12 ngokulethwa ngakunye kanye no-R2.50 ngekhilomitha ngalinye.',
  'The date of birth in that number is not a real date.': 'Usuku lokuzalwa kuleyo nombolo alusiyo usuku lwangempela.',
  'The distance is worked out when you ask.': 'Ibanga liyabalwa uma ucela.',
  'The farm brings it itself.': 'Ipulazi liyilethela lona uqobo.',
  'The farm brings it to you': 'Ipulazi liyakuletha',
  'The farm packs your order once the card payment goes through. Your money is held safely until you confirm delivery. This page updates by itself.': 'Ipulazi lipaka i-oda lakho uma inkokhelo yekhadi isiphumelele. Imali yakho igcinwa kahle kuze kube uqinisekisa ukulethwa. Leli khasi liyabuyekezwa lodwa.',
  'The front of your ID card or the photo page of your smart card, in good light.': 'Ingaphambili likakhadi lakho le-ID noma ikhasi lesithombe likakhadi lakho elihlakaniphile, ekukhanyeni okuhle.',
  'The front of your ID card, in good light.': 'Ingaphambili likakhadi lakho le-ID, ekukhanyeni okuhle.',
  'The order is still being saved. Try again in a moment.': 'I-oda lisagcinwa. Zama futhi ngomzuzwana.',
  'The plan does not call for water today.': 'Uhlelo aludingi amanzi namuhla.',
  'The provider acknowledges requests and sends trucks. Farms with a borehole or tanker can also answer through Nolifa Grow.': 'Umhlinzeki uyavuma izicelo futhi athumele amaloli. Amapulazi anebhorehole noma ithanka angaphendula nge-Nolifa Grow.',
  'The radar needs at least 4 readings before it forecasts.': 'Irada idinga okungenani ukufundwa okungu-4 ngaphambi kokuthi ibikezele.',
  'The radar needs at least 4 readings from the provider before it can forecast.': 'Irada idinga okungenani ukufundwa okungu-4 ovela kumhlinzeki ngaphambi kokuthi ibikezele.',
  'The server records the amount when the customer\'s PIN is accepted, and it is released when they confirm, or automatically after 2 hours. ': 'Iseva ibhala inani lapho i-PIN yekhasimende yamukelwa, futhi likhululwa uma liqinisekisa, noma ngokuzenzakalelayo ngemva kwamahora ama-2. ',
  'The tools that protect a farm never cost anything.': 'Amathuluzi avikela ipulazi awabizi lutho.',
  'The valve link is not a web address.': 'Isixhumanisi sevalvu asiyona ikheli lewebhu.',
  'The valve link must start with http:// or https://': 'Isixhumanisi sevalvu kumele siqale ngo-http:// noma https://',
  'The vet will tell you which dip or treatment to use and how often': 'Udokotela wezilwane uzokutshela ukuthi yiliphi icwiliso noma ukwelashwa okumele usebenzise nokuthi kaningi kangakanani',
  'The vet\'s diagnosis': 'Ukuxilongwa kukadokotela wezilwane',
  'The warehouse checks them in when they arrive.': 'I-warehouse iyangenisa lapho zifika.',
  'The wide picture at the top of your store in Nolifa Drop. Your products, your farm, your team.': 'Isithombe esibanzi phezulu esitolo sakho ku-Nolifa Drop. Imikhiqizo yakho, ipulazi lakho, ithimba lakho.',
  'The year in that number is not right.': 'Unyaka kuleyo nombolo awulungile.',
  'Then': 'Ngemva kwalokho',
  'These are bulk supply dams, updated weekly. A healthy dam does not mean every tap is running: local outages come from pipes and pumps, which is what community reports and votes are for.': 'Lawa amadamu amakhulu okunikeza, abuyekezwa ngamasonto. Idamu eliphilile alisho njalo ukuthi zonke amapompi ziyasebenza: ukucisha kwasendaweni kuvela emapayipini nasezipompini, okuyilokho imibiko yomphakathi namavoti okuyilokho.',
  'This animal is no longer on the register.': 'Lesi silwane asisekho ohlwini.',
  'This deposit is not waiting to be checked in.': 'Lokhu kunikezwa akulindele ukungeniswa.',
  'This desk is for the water provider': 'Leli deski lomhlinzeki wamanzi',
  'This diagnosis is AI-generated and is intended as a guide only. Always consult a qualified agricultural expert or extension officer for serious crop concerns.': 'Lokhu kuxilongwa kukhiqizwe yi-AI futhi kuhloselwe ukuba isiqondiso kuphela. Njalo xhumana nochwepheshe wezolimo oqeqeshiwe noma isisebenzi sokunweba ngezinkinga ezinkulu zezitshalo.',
  'This farm is not selling right now.': 'Leli pulazi alithengisi okwamanje.',
  'This is a controlled disease. By law you must report it.': 'Lesi sifo silawulwayo. Ngokomthetho kumele usibike.',
  'This is a remote opinion from a video. If the animal gets worse, call a vet to see it in person.': 'Lokhu kungumbono wokude ovela evidiyweni. Uma isilwane siba sibi, biza udokotela wezilwane ukuze asibone ngokubona.',
  'This is a serious disease that can destroy your entire crop quickly. Dark water-soaked patches appear on leaves and stems. White mold may be visible underneath leaves.': 'Lesi yisifo esiqatha esingalibhubhisa lonke isitshalo sakho ngokushesha. Amabala amnyama agcwele amanzi avela emaqabungeni nasezindebeni. Isikhunta esimhlophe singabonakala ngaphansi kwamaqabunga.',
  'This is what buyers in the shop see.': 'Yilokhu abathengi abakubona esitolo.',
  'This payment was already released. Contact FNB customer care for a review.': 'Le nkokhelo isivele ikhishiwe. Xhumana nokunakekelwa kwamakhasimende e-FNB ukuze kubuyekezwe.',
  'This phone would not let the app save your account. Restart the app and try again.': 'Le foni ayivumanga uhlelo ukuthi lugcine i-akhawunti yakho. Qala kabusha uhlelo uzame futhi.',
  'This plot was removed.': 'Leli thafa lisusiwe.',
  'This removes your sign-in, your profile, your herd and health records, your listings, your photos and ID documents, and your vet cases. It cannot be undone.\n\n': 'Lokhu kususa ukungena kwakho, iphrofayili yakho, umhlambi wakho namarekhodi empilo, imibhalo yakho, izithombe zakho namadokhumenti e-ID, namacala akho kadokotela wezilwane. Akunakuhlehliswa.\\n\\n\n\n',
  'This removes your sign-in, your profile, your herd and health records, your listings, your photos and ID documents, and your vet cases. It cannot be undone.\n\nFinished orders stay for the other person\'s accounts, with your name and address taken out. A membership you paid for is not refunded.': 'Lokhu kususa ukungena kwakho, iphrofayili yakho, umhlambi wakho namarekhodi empilo, imibhalo yakho, izithombe zakho namadokhumenti e-ID, namacala akho kadokotela wezilwane. Akunakuhlehliswa.\\n\\n\n\nAma-oda aqediwe ahlala ku-akhawunti zomunye umuntu, igama nekheli lakho kususiwe. Ubulungu obukhokhele abubuyiselwa imali.',
  'This request is already with the provider.': 'Lesi sicelo sesivele sikumhlinzeki.',
  'This uses a demo forecast.': 'Lokhu kusebenzisa isibikezelo sedemo.',
  'This uses the last saved forecast because there is no signal.': 'Lokhu kusebenzisa isibikezelo sokugcina esigciniwe ngoba akukho uphawu.',
  'Thoroughbred': 'IThoroughbred',
  'Three-Day Stiffsickness': 'I-Three-Day Stiffsickness',
  'Thu': 'Lwesine',
  'Tick everything that applies. The more you tick, the better the guidance.': 'Maka konke okusebenzayo. Okuningi okumakayo, siqondiso esingcono.',
  'Tick the signs you see. Controlled diseases like foot-and-mouth are flagged first, with who to call.': 'Khetha izimpawu ozibonayo. Izifo ezilawulwayo njengesifo sezinyawo nomlomo ziqala ukuboniswa, kanye nokuthi ubize bani.',
  'Tick the signs you see. It flags controlled diseases and emergencies first. It is guidance, not a diagnosis.': 'Maka izimpawu ozibonayo. Ichaza izifo ezilawulwayo nezimo eziphuthumayo kuqala. Iluleko, hhayi ukuxilongwa.',
  'Tick what you see and get guidance': 'Maka okubonayo uthole isiqondiso',
  'Time to feed your animals. Tick it off in Nolifa Grow when it is done.': 'Isikhathi sokuphakela izilwane zakho. Kumake ku-Nolifa Grow uma sekwenziwe.',
  'Tiny insects are tunneling inside your leaves leaving winding white or yellow trails. This weakens the plant and reduces its ability to absorb sunlight.': 'Izinambuzane ezincane zigubha ngaphakathi emaqabungeni zishiya imizila ejikelezayo emhlophe noma ephuzi. Lokhu kwenza isitshalo sibe buthakathaka futhi kuncishise amandla aso okufunxa ukukhanya kwelanga.',
  'Tiny soft-bodied insects are feeding on your plant sap. Aphids cluster on new growth and the underside of leaves causing curling, yellowing, and stunted growth. They also spread viral diseases between plants.': 'Izinambuzane ezincane ezithambile zidla ujusi wesitshalo sakho. Ama-aphid ahlangana ekukhuleni okusha nangaphansi kwamaqabunga abangela ukugoqeka, ukuphuzi nokukhula okumile. Asakaza nezifo zamagciwane phakathi kwezitshalo.',
  'Tiny white flying insects are attacking your plant. Whiteflies feed on plant sap from the underside of leaves causing yellowing and wilting. They also produce sticky honeydew that leads to black sooty mould.': 'Izinambuzane ezincane ezimhlophe eziandizayo zihlasela isitshalo sakho. Ama-whitefly adla ujusi wesitshalo ngaphansi kwamaqabunga abangela ukuphuzi nokuphuphuma. Akhiqiza futhi uju oluncangathelayo oluholela esikhuntini esimnyama.',
  'Title deed or lease or PTO letter, brand or livestock owner registration, animal health certificate or vet letter, food safety papers if you have them.': 'Isivumelwano somhlaba noma ileyisi noma incwadi ye-PTO, ukubhaliswa kwebhrendi noma komnikazi wezilwane, isitifiketi sempilo yezilwane noma incwadi kadokotela, amaphepha okuphepha kokudla uma unawo.',
  'To switch between demo and live mode, open Trust and Safety and use App mode.': 'Ukushintsha phakathi kwedemo nemodi ephilayo, vula Ukwethembeka Nokuphepha uphinde usebenzise Imodi Yohlelo.',
  'Today': 'Namuhla',
  'Today it works while the app is open. Running with the phone locked needs a small hub on the farm. That is on the road map.': 'Namuhla isebenza kuphela ngenkathi uhlelo luvuliwe. Ukusebenza ifoni ikhiyiwe kudinga i-hab encane epulazini. Lokho kusohlelweni lwendlela.',
