  'We check your ID, your business, where the farm is and how big, your certificates, and how you look after your animals and crops. Nolifa staff review it before you sell.': 'Sihlola i-ID yakho, ibhizinisi lakho, lapho ipulazi likhona nokuthi likhulu kangakanani, amasertifikhethi akho, nendlela unakekela ngayo izilwane nezitshalo zakho. Abasebenzi be-Nolifa bayakubuyekeza ngaphambi kokuthi uthengise.',
  'We could not check the PIN. Check your signal and try again.': 'Asikwazanga ukuhlola i-PIN. Hlola uphawu lwakho bese uzama futhi.',
  'We could not find your position. Turn on location for Nolifa Grow and stand on the farm.': 'Ayikwazanga ukuthola indawo yakho. Vula indawo ku-Nolifa Grow uma ume epulazini.',
  'We could not find your position. Turn on location, or stand where the borehole should go.': 'Ayikwazanga ukuthola indawo yakho. Vula indawo, noma ume lapho ibhorehole kufanele ibe khona.',
  'We could not identify the disease clearly from this photo. Try taking another photo in better lighting, closer to the most affected leaf.': 'Asikwazanga ukubona isifo ngokucacile kulesi sithombe. Zama ukuthatha esinye isithombe ngokukhanya okungcono, eduze nelaqabunga elithintekile kakhulu.',
  'We could not open the camera or photos. Allow access in Settings and try again.': 'Ayikwazanga ukuvula ikhamera noma izithombe. Vumela ukufinyelela ku-Settings uzame futhi.',
  'We could not open the payment page. Try again.': 'Ayikwazanga ukuvula ikhasi lenkokhelo. Zama futhi.',
  'We could not open your photos. Allow access in Settings and try again.': 'Asikwazanga ukuvula izithombe zakho. Vumela ukufinyelela Kuzilungiselelo bese uyazama futhi.',
  'We could not reach the card service. Check your signal and try again.': 'Asikwazanga ukufinyelela insizakalo yamakhadi. Hlola isignali yakho bese uyazama futhi.',
  'We could not reach the server. Check your connection, then try again.': 'Asikwazanga ukufinyelela iseva. Hlola uxhumo lwakho, bese uzama futhi.',
  'We could not read that video. Try filming it again.': 'Ayikwazanga ukufunda leyo vidiyo. Zama ukuyirekhoda futhi.',
  'We could not sign you in. Try again.': 'Asikwazanga ukukungenisa. Zama futhi.',
  'We follow POPIA. Your records are encrypted and never sold.': 'Silandela i-POPIA. Amarekhodi akho ayafihlwa futhi awakaze athengiswe.',
  'We keep this honest record. A vet can then advise which vaccines your herd needs in your area.': 'Sigcina leli rekhodi eliqotho. Udokotela wezilwane angabe eseluleka ukuthi yimaphi amagomo adingwa umhlambi wakho endaweni yakho.',
  'We watch dam levels, roads and outbreak reports for your area. A warning shows up here and as a notification the moment one appears.': 'Siqapha amazinga edamu, imigwaqo nemibiko yokuqubuka endaweni yakho. Isexwayiso sivela lapha futhi njengesaziso ngokushesha lapho sivela.',
  'Wear gloves and a mask when handling dead or aborted animals, and bury them deep': 'Gqoka amagilavu nomask uma uphatha izilwane ezifile noma eziphuphuthekile, uzingcwabe ujule',
  'Wear gloves when handling affected animals and wash your hands': 'Gqoka amagilavu uma uphatha izilwane ezithintekile futhi uhlanze izandla zakho',
