  'What works offline': 'Okusebenza ungekho ku-inthanethi',
  'What you planted and when. The AI works out the rest.': 'Okutshale nokuthi nini. I-AI ibala okunye.',
  'When delivery goes wrong': 'Lapho ukulethwa kungahambi kahle',
  'When you are connected to the internet, Nolifa Grow uses advanced cloud AI to analyse your plant image and identify diseases with high accuracy across hundreds of plant conditions.\n\nWhen you are offline, the app switches automatically to an on-device AI model so you always get a diagnosis even in a field with no signal.': 'Uma uxhumeke ku-inthanethi, i-Nolifa Grow isebenzisa i-AI ephezulu yelifu ukuhlaziya isithombe sesitshalo sakho futhi ibone izifo ngokunemba okuphezulu ezimeni ezingaphezu kwekhulu zezitshalo.\\n\\nUma ungekho ku-inthanethi, uhlelo lushintshela ngokuzenzakalelayo kumodeli ye-AI esefonini ukuze uthole ukuxilongwa njalo noma ensimini engenawo umkhawulo.',
  'Where are they?': 'Zikuphi?',
