  'With Nolifa for review. We will message you. You cannot change it while we look.': 'Kuse-Nolifa ukuze kubuyekezwe. Sizokuthumelela umyalezo. Awukwazi ukukushintsha ngenkathi sibheka.',
  'With Nolifa for review. We will tell you when you can start.': 'Kuse-Nolifa ukuze kubuyekezwe. Sizokutshela uma ungaqala.',
  'Without quick treatment the bone in the hoof can rotate.': 'Ngaphandle kokwelashwa okusheshayo ithambo elisensimbini lingajika.',
  'Wool coming off, rubbing and itching': 'Uboya buyawa, ukuhuzuka nokuhlohla',
  'Words alone cannot tell a vet what is wrong. Film the animal, and a vet will watch it, say what they think it is and why, and tell you what to do.': 'Amazwi odwa awakwazi ukutshela udokotela wezilwane ukuthi kuphi okungalungile. Rekhoda isilwane, udokotela wezilwane uzobuka, athi uthi yini nokuthi kungani, futhi akutshele ukuthi wenzeni.',
  'Works with no signal': 'Isebenza ngaphandle kophawu',
  'Worms': 'Izibungu',
  'Worms are now resistant to many dewormers, so guessing wastes money.': 'Izibungu manje zimelana nemithi eminingi yezibungu, ngakho ukuqagela kuchitha imali.',
  'Written off': 'Kulahlwe',
  'Wrong or missing items': 'Izinto ezingalungile noma ezilahlekile',
  'Yellow V-shaped lesions are appearing at the edges of your cabbage or brassica leaves pointing toward the centre. The veins inside the leaf turn black. This bacterial disease spreads through water splash and contaminated tools.': 'Izilonda eziphuzi ezimise okwe-V zivela emaphethelweni amaqabunga akho amakhabishi noma e-brassica ziqonde maphakathi. Imithambo ngaphakathi kwelaqabunga iba mnyama. Lesi sifo se-bacteria sisakazeka ngokuphalaza kwamanzi namathuluzi angcolisiwe.',
  'Yellow gums or eyes': 'Amagagasi noma amehlo aphuzi',
  'Yellow sticky traps placed near plants can catch adult flies': 'Izicupho eziphuzi ezinamathelayo ezibekwe eduze nezitshalo zingabamba izimpukane ezindala',
  'Yellow streaks or stripes are running along your maize leaves. This viral disease is spread by leafhoppers and is very common in KwaZulu-Natal. There is no cure once a plant is infected.': 'Imigqa eyephuzi noma imivimbo igijima emaqabungeni akho ommbila. Lesi sifo segciwane sisakazwa yizimpukane zamaqabunga futhi sivame kakhulu KwaZulu-Natal. Asikho isikhathi sokwelapha uma isitshalo sesithelelekile.',
