  'You also pay a commission only when a sale completes, so a farm that sells nothing owes only the plan. ': 'Ukhokha futhi ikhomishini kuphela uma ukuthengisa kuphela, ngakho ipulazi elingathengisi lutho lidla kuphela uhlelo. ',
