  'You are online': 'Uku-inthanethi',
  'You are outside KwaZulu-Natal. Real dam data for your province is not in the app yet, so these are the KwaZulu-Natal dams.': 'Ungaphandle kweKwaZulu-Natal. Idatha yangempela yedamu yesifundazwe sakho ayikho kuhlelo okwamanje, ngakho lena amadamu aseKwaZulu-Natal.',
  'You are paid for every job in it once each is delivered with the customer PIN.': 'Ukhokhelwa kuwo wonke amajoba akulo uma ngamunye elethwe nge-PIN yekhasimende.',
