  'You bring orders to the customer yourself. You keep the whole delivery fee you set, and the customer\'s PIN still releases your payment.': 'Uletha ama-oda ekhasimende wena uqobo. Ugcina yonke imali yokulethwa oyibekile, futhi i-PIN yekhasimende isakhulula inkokhelo yakho.',
  'You can list stock once your store is registered, verified and on a plan.': 'Ungabhala isitoko uma isitolo sakho sibhalisiwe, siqinisekisiwe futhi sinohlelo.',
