  'You have saved': 'Ugodile',
  'You have sent a lot of reports today. Try again tomorrow.': 'Uthumele imibiko eminingi namuhla. Zama futhi kusasa.',
  'You must be 18 or older to sell on Nolifa.': 'Kumele ube neminyaka engu-18 noma ngaphezulu ukuze uthengise ku-Nolifa.',
  'You only see real people, real listings and real water readings.': 'Ubona kuphela abantu bangempela, imibhalo yangempela nokufundwa kwamanzi kwangempela.',
  'You pay into escrow. The farm is paid only after you give the delivery PIN or the protection window ends.': 'Ukhokha ku-escrow. Ipulazi likhokhelwa kuphela ngemva kokunikeza i-PIN yokulethwa noma lapho inkathi yokuvikeleka iphela.',
  'You reached the limit for farms not yet inspected. Book your inspection to lift it.': 'Ufinyelele umkhawulo wamapulazi angakahlolwa. Bhuka ukuhlolwa kwakho ukuze ususe.',
