  'Young that suckle from an infected udder go hungry.': 'Izingane eziyonka esinqeni esithelelekile zihlala zilambile.',
  'Your South African ID number': 'Inombolo yakho ye-ID yaseNingizimu Afrika',
  'Your account': 'I-akhawunti yakho',
  'Your account can approve people and move money, so we confirm it is you. We are emailing you a 6-digit code.': 'I-akhawunti yakho ingavuma abantu futhi isuse imali, ngakho siqinisekisa ukuthi ngowakho. Sikuthumelela ikhodi enezinombolo ezi-6 nge-imeyili.',
