  'Your land': 'Umhlaba wakho',
  'Your live location and job details are being shared with the Nolifa Drop safety team. In an emergency call 10111 or 112.': 'Indawo yakho yamanje nemininingwane yomsebenzi kwabelwana nayo neqembu lokuphepha le-Nolifa Drop. Esimweni esiphuthumayo shaya u-10111 noma u-112.',
  'Your live location and job details are shared with the Nolifa safety team. In an emergency call 10111 or 112.': 'Indawo yakho yamanje nemininingwane yomsebenzi kwabelwana nayo neqembu lokuphepha le-Nolifa. Esimweni esiphuthumayo shaya u-10111 noma u-112.',
  'Your local agricultural extension officer checks on a routine visit. Free in most districts.': 'Isisebenzi sakho sasendaweni sokunweba sezolimo sihlola ekuvakasheni okuvamile. Mahhala ezifundeni eziningi.',
  'Your membership is waiting for payment': 'Ubulungu bakho bulindele inkokhelo',
  'Your money is held safely by FNB until you confirm delivery. Farmers and drivers are paid only then.': 'Imali yakho igcinwa ngokuphepha yi-FNB kuze kube uqinisekisa ukulethwa. Abalimi nabashayeli bakhokhelwa kuphela lapho.',
  'Your money, your goods and your data are protected at every step. Here is exactly how.': 'Imali yakho, impahla yakho nedatha yakho kuvikelwe esinyathelweni ngasinye. Nansi indlela ngqo.',
  'Your name': 'Igama lakho',
  'Your own on-farm numbering': 'Inombolo yakho epulazini',
  'Your own store on Nolifa Drop': 'Isitolo sakho ku-Nolifa Drop',
  'Your payouts show here after each delivery.': 'Inkokhelo yakho iyavela lapha ngemva kokulethwa ngakunye.',
  'Your phone is verified. You can vote on water requests.': 'Ifoni yakho iqinisekisiwe. Ungavota ezicelweni zamanzi.',
  'Your phone reminds you at these times. What you tick off builds your farm record, which vets and buyers can trust.': 'Ifoni yakho ikukhumbuza ngalezi zikhathi. Lokho okukumakayo kwakha irekhodi lepulazi lakho, odokotela nabathengi abangalethemba.',
  'Your plan': 'Uhlelo lwakho',
  'Your plant diagnoses will appear here': 'Ukuxilongwa kwezitshalo zakho kuzovela lapha',
  'Your plant has a bacterial infection. Bacteria cause water-soaked spots, yellowing leaves, and rotting tissue. It spreads quickly in wet conditions and through contaminated tools.': 'Isitshalo sakho sinokutheleleka nge-bacteria. I-bacteria ibangela amabala agcwele amanzi, amaqabunga aphuzi nezicubu ezibolayo. Isakazeka ngokushesha ezimeni ezimanzi nangamathuluzi angcolisiwe.',
  'Your plant has a fungal disease that starts on older lower leaves and spreads upward. Dark brown spots with yellow rings appear on the leaves.': 'Isitshalo sakho sinesifo sesikhunta esiqala emaqabungeni amadala aphansi futhi sisakazeke phezulu. Amabala ansundu amnyama anamasongo aphuzi avela emaqabungeni.',
  'Your plant has a fungal infection. Fungi spread through spores carried by wind and water. They thrive in warm humid conditions and can spread to nearby plants quickly.': 'Isitshalo sakho sinokutheleleka ngesikhunta. Izikhunta zisakazeka ngezinhlamvu ezithwalwa umoya namanzi. Zikhula ezimeni ezifudumele ezinomswakama futhi zingasakazeka ezitshalweni eziseduze ngokushesha.',
  'Your plant has a viral infection showing as patchy yellow and green mottled patterns on the leaves. This disease is spread by insects especially aphids and has no cure.': 'Isitshalo sakho sinokutheleleka kwegciwane okubonakala ngamaphethini amabala aphuzi nahlaza emaqabungeni. Lesi sifo sisakazwa yizinambuzane ikakhulukazi ama-aphid futhi asinakho ukwelashwa.',
  'Your plant has been damaged by excessive direct sunlight. Bleached white or brown crispy patches appear on leaves that face the sun directly. This is not a disease and will not spread.': 'Isitshalo sakho senziwe umonakalo yilanga eliqondile ngokweqile. Amabala amhlophe noma ansundu aqhekekayo avela emaqabungeni abheke ilanga ngqo. Lokhu akusiyo isifo futhi akusakazeki.',
